DPDV-20057: dataset-go sends the API token in the Authorization header, not in
the addEvents body. TestConsumeLogsShouldSucceed compared the decoded body
including AuthParams.Token; this makes it accept the key in either place.

Upstream: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector-contrib/pull/53539
(the same change). Delete this file once that is merged.

